Package: wrong-pedestrian-lights
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: find suspicious pedestrian signals in OSM data
 Scans OSM PBF files for a traffic_signals node, a single
 crossing=traffic_signals node and another traffic_signals node on the
 same car road without junctions in between. Writes buffered bounding
 boxes as GeoJSON or SpatiaLite.
